<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A Court For Children shall consist of a Judge of the Sessions Court who, in the exercise of his functions as a Court For Children except when making an order under subsection 39(4), 42(4), 84(2) or 86(1), as the case may require, shall be assisted by two advisers to be appointed by the Minister from a panel of persons resident in the State."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
