<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The age so declared by the Court For Children under subsection (2) shall be deemed to be the true age of that person, unless and until the contrary is proved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
