<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_V__chp_2__cl_20__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If a Protector or police officer does not take a child into temporary custody under section 18 but he is satisfied on reasonable grounds that the child is in need of medical examination or treatment, he may direct in writing the person who appears to him to have the care of the child for the time being to immediately take the child to a medical officer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_V__chp_2__cl_20__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_V__chp_2__cl_20> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
