<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_V__chp_2__cl_27__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "If a medical officer or a registered medical practitioner believes on reasonable grounds that a child he is examining or treating is physically or emotionally injured as a result of being ill-treated, neglected, abandoned or exposed, or is sexually abused, he shall immediately inform a Protector."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
