<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_V__chp_2__cl_27__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any medical officer or registered medical practitioner who fails to comply with subsection (1) commits an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
