<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Except as provided in subsections (4) and (6), a witness in any civil or criminal proceedings shall not be obliged or permitted to disclose the name and address of an informer or the substance of the information received from him or to state any matter which might lead to his discovery."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If any book, record or document which is in evidence or liable to inspection in any civil or criminal proceedings contains any entry in which any informer is named or described or which might lead to his discovery, the Court shall cause all such passages to be concealed from view or to be obliterated so far as may be necessary to protect the informer from discovery."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XIII__cl_116__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
