<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XV__cl_129> <https://schema.org/text> "\"appointed date\" means the date on which this Act comes into operation; \"Juvenile Court\" means the Juvenile Court established under the Juvenile Courts Act 1947 [Act 90]; \"repealed Acts\" means the Juveniles Court Act 1947 and the Child Protection Act 1991 [Act 468] repealed under this Act. Repeal"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
