<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XV__cl_131> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "131" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
