<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XV__cl_132> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_XV__cl_132> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "132" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
