<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_X__chp_2__cl_89> <https://schema.org/text> "If in any case the Court For Children considers it necessary in the best interests of the child, the Court may require his parents or guardian, as the case may be, to withdraw from the Court. Child Procedure in Court For Children"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
