<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_95__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Prosecutor or any child or his parent or guardian, if aggrieved by any finding or order of a Court For Children, may appeal to the High Court against such finding or order in accordance with the provisions of the Criminal Procedure Code relating to criminal appeals to the High Court from a Sessions Court."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_95__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_95> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
