<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_95__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any appeal under this section shall, notwithstanding any other written law, be intituled \"Appeal By Children\" and in dealing with any such appeal, sections 12 and 15 shall apply, with such modifications as may be necessary, to the High Court. Restrictions on order of imprisonment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/24/eng@> .
